Jianlai video storyboard adaptation

This application includes video storyboard editing code adapted from Nomi:
https://github.com/aqm857886159/Nomi
Upstream commit: 0fdd0da72e9be98430b300e491b6bd47f7d79976
Upstream license: GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 only.

The adapted module is ui/src/chat/nomi/storyboard-edits.ts. Changes remove
Nomi's desktop/workbench state, scene identity migration and plan renumbering,
and integrate scalar storyboard rows with the existing single-video workflow.
